- agents.spawn(prompt="...", name="...", definition="child-name", capabilities=[...], tools=[...], budgets={...}, report="notice"|"inline"|"message"), agents.submit(id="...", text="...", delivery="steer"(default)|"queued"), agents.wait(ids=[...], timeout_ms=N), agents.inspect(id="...", include_grants=False), agents.list(), agents.stop(id="..."), agents.delete(id="...")
- messages.send(recipient="...", subject="...", body="...", evidence_handle="...", delivery="queued"|"steer"|"next_turn"), messages.list(status="pending"|"delivered"|"done"|"all", sender="", limit=50), messages.read(id="..."), messages.complete(ids=[...]), messages.defer(id="...", until="RFC3339" or seconds=N)
- mcp.list_servers(), mcp.list_tools(server="..."), mcp.instructions(server="..."), mcp.call(server="...", tool="...", arguments={...})
- state.private_get/private_set/private_append/private_cas/private_list and state.blackboard_get/blackboard_set/blackboard_append/blackboard_cas/blackboard_history; use key="...", value=..., and version=N for CAS. Small records have a decoded value, e.g. state.private_get(key="progress")["value"]. Lists/history return items, next, truncated; pass the returned next fields for another page.
